# Harness Sketch

Describe Juno's role and task: Juno maintains a view that synthesises and summarises all existing feature requests into common themes based on their problem statements.

_Rough first pass, Module 3 Lab 1. Not the AI PRD._

## 01 · Context
It has access to the raw signals in both Slack and JIRA

## 02 · Tools
It can read and write to the Notion dashboard/table

## 03 · Loop
It has one daily pass

## 04 · Memory
Nothing yet

## 05 · Permissions
It can read Slack and JIRA (but it cannot write). It can read and write to the Notion dashboard/table

## 06 · Verification
The only verification that exists is that each problem should have a corresponding Slack or JIRA ticket request reference. If it does not have a ticket reference it should not be included. No assumptions should be made and fictional tickets should be used. This is only verified manually by the PM.
